WEBVTT

00:05:29.584 --> 00:05:33.096
Sasa,hii inaonesha kwamba kuwakumbusha watu kuhusu kifo

00:05:33.111 --> 00:05:36.341
inawachochea kuamini,bila kujali ukweli,

00:05:36.341 --> 00:05:38.366
na sio kwa dini tu,

00:05:38.366 --> 00:05:40.603
katika imani yoyote ile

00:05:40.603 --> 00:05:44.063
ambayo inaeleza kifo katika njia tofauti tofauti,

00:05:44.063 --> 00:05:45.868
haijalishi kama inakuwa maarufu

00:05:45.868 --> 00:05:47.282
au kuwa na watoto

00:05:47.282 --> 00:05:48.629
au utaifa,

00:05:48.629 --> 00:05:51.902
ambayo inasema utaishi siku zote.

00:05:51.902 --> 00:05:53.833
Huu ni upendeleo uliotengeneza umbile

00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:57.172
na historia y binadamu.

00:05:57.172 --> 00:05:59.439
Sasa,fikra iliyopo katika upendeleo huu

00:05:59.439 --> 00:06:01.176
katika tafiti 400